3a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-214-writers-room-justice-comics-695\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #214: Writers' Room: Justice Comics #695</a></h3>\n\n  <p>We'll paint you a story!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1: It's Adam's birthday! Today is the day! As a result — or, actually, because you demanded it — we tell a frankly silly story that ends up doing some interesting things. And also we read your letters!...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
