        "created_at": "2022-06-02T01:36:20.663Z",
        "cooked": "<p>From the original notes we have on him from episode 115:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Mr. Hideous was a guy in a spooky ghost mask who used poisonous gas to confront people with their greatest fears, etc. He got revamped quite a bit in the ’80s as a victim of his own crimes - overexposure to his own gas left him horribly scarred, so he stopped wearing the mask (his own face being pretty bad on its own now) and and started wearing tacky suits. His gimmick went from being “I will terrify you” to “I will show you how terrible I am”</p>\n</blockquote>",
